{"title":"세뇌","artist":"Neru","sourceId":"reference:5Hf4CSsl6W1NYwGHrQ1e","sourceHash":"463509e1ff6c97748646f2a3aa4eb269c683b028329bfa396bced85592670ea5","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lyric_character_matching","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":16.19,"end":23.36,"text":"人に生まれ　人になるため","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":23.36,"end":27.06,"text":"明日と言う名の　カバン背負って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":27.06,"end":30.83,"text":"有り触れた　未来を詰めた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":30.83,"end":34.75,"text":"配給の列は　大渋滞だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":34.75,"end":38.04,"text":"ただ望まれる事も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":38.04,"end":42.12,"text":"ただ選ばれる事も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":42.12,"end":46.27,"text":"この腕では　支え切れず","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":46.27,"end":49.98,"text":"命は張り裂けた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":49.98,"end":55.6,"text":"死にたがる動機はどうせ無いけれど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":55.6,"end":58.94,"text":"生きてみる道理もなくて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":58.94,"end":63.5,"text":"これからもそれはきっと揺るがない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":63.5,"end":67.58,"text":"ならば今を生きている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":67.58,"end":79.07,"text":"僕等何に縋ればいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":79.07,"end":82.67,"text":"人に生まれ　人になれずに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":82.67,"end":86.67,"text":"列は今では　墓場のようだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":86.67,"end":90.33,"text":"残された　未来の腐臭も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":90.33,"end":94.8,"text":"酸鼻を極め　明日ごと燃やした","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":94.8,"end":98.13,"text":"ただ許される事が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":98.13,"end":102.0,"text":"まだ信じられなくて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":102.0,"end":105.92,"text":"笑い者に　されるならと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":105.92,"end":109.72999999999999,"text":"命に鍵掛けた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":109.72999999999999,"end":115.64,"text":"愛される事だけが全てだと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":115.64,"end":119.24000000000001,"text":"その教鞭を執るのなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":119.24000000000001,"end":123.11,"text":"その教科書だとか図鑑とやらは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":123.11,"end":126.96,"text":"この胸にぽっかり開いた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":126.96,"end":146.48,"text":"穴をどう説いているんですか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":146.48,"end":153.36,"text":"頬を伝った　涙の跡を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":153.36,"end":158.09,"text":"追い掛けて　行き着いた先で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":158.09,"end":161.57,"text":"捨てられたまま　痩せこけていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":161.57,"end":167.15,"text":"夢たちが凍えていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":167.15,"end":170.98,"text":"時だけが残酷に過ぎて往けど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":170.98,"end":174.84,"text":"変わらない胸裏の傷愴と","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":174.84,"end":178.62,"text":"変われない置いてけぼりの僕等を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":178.62,"end":182.62,"text":"過去たちが嘲笑っている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":182.62,"end":186.78,"text":"剥き出しの心は言葉と呼ぶ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":186.78,"end":190.17,"text":"雨霰に曝されて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":190.17,"end":194.04,"text":"息も絶え絶えになったこの脈を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":194.04,"end":198.06,"text":"どうかそっと暖めてくれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":198.06,"end":202.05,"text":"その両手で暖めてくれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}